                <pb facs="0763" n="675" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg675"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Tyler to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-10-26"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 26,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Tyler reports that according to a telegram from the Crown Prince a
                    detachment of fifty mounted men have been dispatched to arrest the
                    murderers.)</p>
            </div>
